  "description": "People make many decisions after reading reviews. Things to wear, things to eat, and men. A dating app where you can see data reviews! \\[Pulse Peak\\] Hye-Rin, who is writing a review today, ends up sleeping with Kwon Mu-Ho, a gymnast who went on a date with her friend due to a trap. Hye-Rin never does it twice with a guy she has done once, but for some reason, she wants to keep doing it with Mu-Ho…?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Second story in RIDI's Dopamine Danpyeonseon (도파민 단편선) Collection.*",
